    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知：　解： $F_A=g\\rho_{\\text{液}}V$",
        "$V=1.6$米$^3$　$F_A=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times1030$千克/米$^3$",
        "$\\rho_{\\text{液}}=1030$千克/米$^3$　$\\times1.6$米$^3=16480$牛顿$\\approx16.5$千牛",
        "$F_A$—？　顿."
